# Root .gitignore has bare `*.png` and `public` rules (for test screenshots /
# other apps' Gatsby/Next output) that would otherwise silently drop this
# project's own scaffold assets. Re-include them so the tree is self-contained.
!src/assets/*.png
!/public/
!/public/**
